#: acl/aclentrydialog.cpp:93
msgid "&User identifier:"
msgstr "Bruker-&Kennen:"

#: acl/aclentrydialog.cpp:101
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"The User Identifier is the login of the user on the IMAP server. This can be "
"a simple user name or the full email address of the user; the login for your "
"own account on the server will tell you which one it is."
msgstr ""
"De Bruker-Kennen is den Bruker sien Anmellnaam op den IMAP-Server. Dat kann "
"en eenfach Brukernaam oder sien heel Nettpostadress wesen; de Anmellnaam för "
"Dien egen Konto seggt Di, wat dat is."

#: acl/aclentrydialog.cpp:105
msgctxt "select an email address"
msgid "Se&lect..."
msgstr "&Utsöken..."

